# Repo dev-environment defaults — auto-loaded by `pipenv run` / `pipenv shell`.
#
# NWAVE_FRESHNESS=skip — bypass the DES freshness gate (§1.8 + DDD-10 of
# docs/feature/fix-des-self-hosted-gate-sync/feature-delta.md) when working
# against the repo's dev tree. Without this, every `pipenv run python -m
# des.cli.*` deterministically REFUSES with exit 78 (DEGRADED — no install
# manifest), because the gate's manifest writer lives in slice-02. The bypass
# is audit-bearing: each invocation emits a structured
# `des.runtime.freshness.skipped` event on stderr so the bypass is visible.
#
# Customers installing via PyPI do NOT pick this file up — their installed
# package carries an `_install_manifest.json` written by the install plugin
# (slice-02) and the gate proceeds silently per the four-state truth table.
NWAVE_FRESHNESS=skip
